at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Residential space; access is for residents and their authorized guests under current housing rules. Coordinate kitchen use with residents and follow posted safety requirements.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"north-hall-courtyard","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"North Hall Courtyard","title":"Take a Casual Game Into the Courtyard","subtitle":"Shared outdoor space at North Residence Hall","notes":"Join residents for a low-key courtyard game or use the adjacent grass, keeping paths clear and respecting residence-hall quiet expectations.","short_summary":"A residence-hall courtyard documented as a setting for conversation, informal games, and time on the grass.","evidence_claim":"The official housing page says North Hall residents socialize and play hacky sack, frisbee, and basketball in the courtyard or lounge on the grass.","source_url":"https://www.hmc.edu/residential/halls/","source_title":"Residence Halls | Housing and Residential Life | Harvey Mudd College","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The courtyard serves a residence hall. Visitors should accompany or coordinate with a resident and follow housing, noise, and guest policies.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"wayne-and-julie-drinkward-residence-hall","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Wayne ’73 and Julie Drinkward Residence Hall","title":"Find the Living Learning Community","subtitle":"Home of Harvey Mudd’s LLC","notes":"Watch for LLC programs announced to the wider HMC community; attend only events identified as open rather than entering residential areas uninvited.","short_summary":"A residence hall housing a Living Learning Community that organizes social-justice events for the Harvey Mudd student body.","evidence_claim":"Harvey Mudd’s housing page identifies Drinkward Hall as home to the Living Learning Community, whose Mudder members host social-justice events for all HMC students.","source_url":"https://www.hmc.edu/residential/halls/","source_title":"Residence Halls | Housing and Residential Life | Harvey Mudd College","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Residence-hall access is limited to residents and authorized guests. LLC events may welcome all HMC students when announced; verify each event’s location and access terms.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
